{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf7\ufe0f \u201cMAHOROBA CAT\u201d</strong> is a photo adventure game themed around <strong>\u201cTourism, Exploration, and Discovery!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is tasked by their boss with taking photos for a travel magazine and sets off on a journey across Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From famous landmarks to hidden gems and everyday scenes, you\u2019ll visit a wide variety of locations to create your own unique travel magazine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying in hotels, traveling by train and airplane\u2014these quintessential travel experiences are also part of the game\u2019s charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold up your camera and take the best shot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.poster.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.webm?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/b100bfcbcf17557c0facdca6b2bf67ec.mp4?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tourist attractions throughout Japan!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can easily visit tourist attractions throughout the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/49d8a82a820396f6fb81333628af1d37.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage inversion system allows you to explore every corner of the diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.poster.avif?t=1754108368\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.webm?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/3268bdd5ea7c0bf1e6a1c404af646117.mp4?t=1754108368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Cat Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3244270/c81eeb73a7deb504698f23f5cc4c1c6b9e07a55b.jpg"},{"name":"Cat Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3244270/9f0e115c6c3b200ba536bbc91727d34a4237f986.jpg"},{"name":"Cat Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3244270/33a0ea03261aadb760d3b2cfe8c5ea091e73328a.jpg"},{"name":"Cat Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3244270/b433e72c95675c8f302d88861f5377a4d3613ab1.jpg"},{"name":"Cat Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3244270/cf9baa54b465a5c86f574ea8a9c344ad494e1806.jpg"},{"name":"First Entry Yamato","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3244270/6469b5b267ff27e7eceefec53194c5fdb258616a.jpg"},{"name":"First Entry Aichi ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3244270/da14f5a609aaba861ab457bd48112d0b67c0bd88.jpg"},{"name":"First Entry Sagami","path":"http